  <Properties>
    <Name>Sukritact's Nabataean Civilization</Name>
    <Teaser>Nabataea: Builders of Petra</Teaser>
    <Description>The Nabataeans were an Arab people who inhabited northern Arabia and the Southern Levant, and whose settlements, most prominently Petra, are famed throughout the world.</Description>
    <Authors>Sukritact, JanBoruta, Regalman</Authors>
